WEBVTT

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:03.768
Here is how JobCairn keeps your search in

00:00:03.808 --> 00:00:04.592
order.

00:00:05.526 --> 00:00:07.431
Home shows your day at a glance:

00:00:07.471 --> 00:00:08.315
what is ready,

00:00:08.355 --> 00:00:09.140
what is next,

00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:11.257
and how the search is going.

00:00:12.390 --> 00:00:15.151
Applications and each job's timeline show where

00:00:15.191 --> 00:00:17.071
every application stands.

00:00:18.208 --> 00:00:20.316
Mail files each reply under its job,

00:00:20.356 --> 00:00:22.407
without you sorting a thing.

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:24.495
Drop in a file,

00:00:24.535 --> 00:00:27.378
and JobCairn suggests where it belongs.

00:00:29.023 --> 00:00:29.739
JobCairn.

00:00:29.779 --> 00:00:32.027
Everything in its place.

